description.text:
One single piercing attack at True Cap Break Level 1, grants Instant ATB 1 & Instant Cast 1 to user;
During Tactical Awoken Mode, Cap Break Level 2 & ATB Speed x1.2 to Earth Abilities, and Weapon Skill Blue/Gold if user has at least Lv.0/2 En-Earth;
WS Blue: Grants [Lv.2 En-Earth Stack] to user
WS Gold: Grants [Dualcast Monk 4 & Weakness Damage +30% for 4 turns to user & Ursula]

